```javascript
const originalPrice = 15;
const numberOfCDs = 10;
const discountPercentage = 40;
const sellingPricePerCD = 40;
const cdsToSell = 5;

const originalTotalCost = originalPrice * numberOfCDs;
const discountAmount = originalTotalCost * (discountPercentage / 100);
const discountedTotalCost = originalTotalCost - discountAmount;
const earnedFromSelling = sellingPricePerCD * cdsToSell;
const remainingCDs = numberOfCDs - cdsToSell;
const costOfRemainingCDs = remainingCDs * originalPrice;

const totalEarned = earnedFromSelling;
const totalCost = discountedTotalCost;
const loss = totalCost - totalEarned;

console.log(loss);
```

```javascript
const originalPrice = 15;
const numberOfCDs = 10;
const discountPercentage = 40;
const sellingPricePerCD = 40;
const cdsToSell = 5;

let totalCost = numberOfCDs * originalPrice;
totalCost *= (1 - discountPercentage / 100);
let earnings = cdsToSell * sellingPricePerCD;
let costOfUnsoldCDs = (numberOfCDs - cdsToSell) * originalPrice;
let actualCost = totalCost + costOfUnsoldCDs;
let expectedEarnings = numberOfCDs * sellingPricePerCD;

let loss = actualCost - expectedEarnings;
console.log(loss);
```

Final Answer: The final answer is $\boxed{25}$
